                <pb facs="0657" n="537" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg537"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Powell to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Port au
                                Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that everything is quiet, that the Syrian shops are closed,
                    and that the government is master of the situation.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
